orption care. Contains ferulic acid to help reduce melanin.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e \u003c!--Enter--\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eHow to use\u003c\/h4\u003e\nAfter cleansing, attach it to the area of concern and gently wipe along the skin texture.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e \u003c!--Enter--\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eIngredients\u003c\/h4\u003e\nWater,Butylene Glycol,Glycerin,Niacinamide,1,2-Hexanediol,Allantoin,Polyglyceryl-10 Laurate,Ethylhexylglycerin,Xanthan Gum,Adenosine,Disodium EDTA,Citric Acid,Fragrance,Panthenol,Sodium Citrate,Cyanocobalamin,Ascorbic Acid,Angelica Archangelica Extract,Glutathione,Capryloyl Salicylic Acid,Ferulic Acid,Gluconolactone, Tocopherol,Nelumbo Nucifera Leaf Extract,Sodium DNA\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e \u003c!--Enter--\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eSpecs\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBrand : Snp\u003cbr\u003eCapacity : 170ml \/ 60 pads\u003cbr\u003eTarget Area : Face\u003cbr\u003eSkin Type : All Skin Types\u003cbr\u003eCountry of origin : South Korea\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c!--kdrop--\u003e\u003c!--↑↑↑↑↑↑Please insert contents↑↑↑↑↑↑↑↑--\u003e","vendor":"Snp","product_type":"Toner Pad","created_at":"2025-07-17T20:14:36-07:00","handle":"snp-glutathione-pdrn-bright-turn-on-pad-170ml-60-pads","updated_at":"2026-10-30T21:28:48-07:00","published_at":"2025-07-17T20:28:45-07:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"global","tags":"Glutathione, new, Niacinamide","variants":[{"id":45126028034204,"product_id":8470088056988,"title":"Default Title","price":"18.32","sku":"Snp Glutathione PDRN Bright Turn-On Pad 170ml (60 pads)","position":1,"compare_at_price":"24.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2025-07-17T20:14:36-07:00","updated_at":"2026-10-30T21:28:48-07:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"Snp Glutathione PDRN Bright Turn-On Pad 170ml (